  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;two non-collinear unit vectors. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math>",
