      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>",
